This integration transforms exact pinned TypeScript sources embedded in the
installed package's source maps. Original SDK files are read-only inputs;
derived SDK files are generated only in an explicit private output directory.
Pi's original copyright and license apply to those derived files. No release,
upstream endorsement, global installation or update is implied.

TypeScript 5.9.3 is a development-only compiler dependency used for syntax-aware
relative import rewriting and public API declaration checks; it is not bundled
with the AgentCenter monitor. Its license remains in node_modules/typescript.
